<title>UK: UK new construction orders -2.0 in 3mths to Aug.</title>
<headline>UK new construction orders -2.0 in 3mths to Aug.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK new construction orders were 2.0 percent down in the three months to August versus the previous three months and unchanged on the same period in 1995, the Department of the Environment said.</p>
<p>		     3/mth vs 3/mth	3/mth vs same 1995 (pct)</p>
<p>    Total		   -2.0			 unch</p>
<p>    Private housing     -9.0			 -2.0</p>
<p>    Infrastructure     +13.0			+15.0</p>
<p>    Public non-housing  -5.0			-23.0</p>
<p>    Private industrial  -8.0			 -1.0</p>
<p>    Private commercial  -6.0			 +8.0</p>
<p>In current prices, the total value of new orders in August alone was 1.76 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
